  "limitations": [
    "Reviewed by a fresh read-only `codex exec` invoked by hand, not by `xtask review`: the controller's predecessor gate refuses P09 subjects until C26 completes; D058 and the owner's 2026-10-26 instruction authorise proceeding. Receipts are regenerated through the controller once C26 completes.",
